{"name": "Kodama: Slumber of the Gods", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Precision Platforming</strong></i><br/>Master tight, responsive controls as you leap, dash, and climb through carefully crafted challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"384\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Fluid Combat</strong></i><br/>Slide, stomp, dodge, and jump your way through enemies in fast-paced encounters. Chain your abilities together to outmaneuver foes and stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Awaken the Kami</strong></i><br/>Discover ancient statues and awaken gods from Japanese folklore. Unlock new abilities that transform how you explore and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/23a237d98e2a8b4e00c518357fa3fe6b.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/23a237d98e2a8b4e00c518357fa3fe6b.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/23a237d98e2a8b4e00c518357fa3fe6b.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>A Colorful Hand-Drawn World</strong></i><br/>Explore a richly detailed, hand-crafted world inspired by Japanese folklore, brought to life with vibrant environments and hand_drawn animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/ee380f610234a9085f917640c9abf2f3.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/ee380f610234a9085f917640c9abf2f3.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/ee380f610234a9085f917640c9abf2f3.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>No AI \"Art\"</i></strong><br/>All visuals are carefully drawn, with no use of AI-generated art, crafted with passion.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Kodama is a 2D hand-drawn action-adventure set in the world of Japanese folklore. Experience fast-paced platforming, fluid combat, and a mystical journey through a colorful, spirit-filled land.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/dff9c3e82ac3278f15e7a5dfaffffcae6135d6f9/header.jpg?t=1780944934", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "Action-Adventure", "Platformer", "2D Platformer", "Metroidvania"], "developers": "VP Games", "publishers": "VP Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4534260", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/TrEnoqWAvRU", "first_seen": 1780610400.0, "review_rank": 482}